flowchart TB
  A[Web application, agent, research, document, connector, or media request] --> B[Workload classification and route policy]
  B --> C[Model instance pool and priority queues]
  B --> D[GPU claims and workload scheduler]
  C --> E[Healthy local instance or remote adapter]
  D --> E
  E --> F[Execution engine\nautonomous, interactive, plan-only]
  F --> G[Context and tool profile]
  G --> H[Containerized workspace and tool broker]
  H --> F
  F --> I[Messages, plans, events, tool results, checkpoints]
  I --> J[(PostgreSQL application state)]
  J --> F
  F --> K[Research, document, connector, media, or user-facing result]
  K --> L[Release instance, claim, workspace, and return to baseline]

  M[OTP supervision and health] --- C
  M --- D
  M --- F
  M --- H
